<title>UK: Argenta Nederland sets 2.0 bln Luxfr bond.</title>
<headline>Argenta Nederland sets 2.0 bln Luxfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager BCEE.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTA NEDERLAND NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ARGENTA BANQUE D'EPARGNE AND</p>
<p>		SOCIETE D'INVESTISSEMENT ARGENTA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FLUX  COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    12.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    12.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
